Decisions Made

Added a one-shot final review-body sweep on the current PR HEAD before clean completion. Review bodies are keyed by review ID and updatedAt so unchanged bodies are processed once and edited bodies are reconsidered.

Problems Encountered

The optional system quick validator could not run because PyYAML was unavailable, and shellcheck was not installed. Repository-native validation and the full deterministic suite passed.

Constraints Identified

The workflow must not wait indefinitely for a review that may never arrive. Only review bodies already present when all other clean gates pass are inspected, and publication remains bound to the same PR HEAD.

Open Questions

None.

Context

Implements the requested shipping-pr behavior demonstrated by karrot-emu/geo-grid PR 159. Changes include runner state, resolver contracts, docs, mocks, and deterministic tests.
